<Project>
  <!--
    The MSBuild properties the DDDToolkit generators read are declared here. A generator only sees a
    property the project lists as a CompilerVisibleProperty, so the list ships in the package the
    generators ship in: wherever they arrive, this file arrives with them. A new property a generator
    reads goes in this file, not in the package of the integration that happens to use it.

    Packed as build/<package id>.props for a project that references the package itself, and as
    buildTransitive/<package id>.props for one that gets it through another package or project.
    Directory.Build.props imports this same file for the projects in this repository, which reference
    the generators as projects and so never restore the package.

    A property that is declared and not set reaches the generator as an empty value. One that is not
    declared does not reach it at all, which is how the generator tells that this file was not
    imported (DDD00014).

    The properties declared elsewhere are SupabaseMigrationsExport, which switches on a build step, and
    IsTestProject and IsTestingPlatformApplication, which keep that step out of test projects.
    DDDToolkit.EntityFramework.Supabase declares them in the targets file that holds the step, so the step
    and its generator cannot arrive apart, nor decide apart where the step runs.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <!--
      Names the generated {Module}EventNames, Add{Module}Converters, Add{Module}IntegrationEvents and
      Add{Module}GraphQlRuntimeBindings in a project that declares no [assembly: Module]. The attribute wins.
    -->
    <CompilerVisibleProperty Include="DDD_Module" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
